D: Evidence 01\"},{\"id\":32,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"\\u2192 Unclassified. Compare this evidence with the current assignment in panels [E] and [Q].\"},{\"id\":33,\"type\":\"command\",\"text\":\"detective@case004:\\/$ cat laptop\\/messages-recovered.txt\"},{\"id\":34,\"type\":\"output\",\"text\":\"RECOVERED THREAD\\n00:52 CLAIRE-BENNETT: Ethan, the procurement files are real. I am followed.\\n00:54 ETHAN: Go to the newsroom safe point. Do not come here.\\n01:06 CLAIRE-BENNETT: [message sent by paired desktop] I'm safe at home. Delete everything.\\nFORENSIC NOTE: 01:06 message signed by desktop key CB-DESK-2, not Claire's phone key CB-PHONE-9.\\nDRAFT 01:16 (unsent): \\\"Blue truck. River cranes. Heard bell every fifteen minutes.\\\"\",\"highlights\":[{\"start\":286,\"end\":297},{\"start\":309,\"end\":327},{\"start\":367,\"end\":377},{\"start\":379,\"end\":391},{\"start\":410,\"end\":425}]},{\"id\":35,\"type\":\"warning\",\"text\":\"The file contains suspicious information, but you need more evidence before establishing \\\"Claire Bennett Abduction Signal\\\".\"},{\"id\":36,\"type\":\"command\",\"text\":\"detective@case004:\\/$ cat scene\\/forensics.txt\"},{\"id\":37,\"type\":\"output\",\"text\":\"FORENSIC PRELIMINARY\\nDeath window: 01:10\\u201301:35 TRUE TIME\\nSedative residue in rinsed cup\\nPartial pressure mark through a torn glove: right thumb area contains a scar-shaped interruption\\nBlue alkyd paint flakes and jute fibers on balcony rail\\nVictim's phone stopped moving at 01:12; wearable motion and heart-rate data indicate a struggle at 01:14\",\"highlights\":[{\"start\":35,\"end\":56},{\"start\":132,\"end\":143},{\"start\":185,\"end\":201},{\"start\":213,\"end\":224}]},{\"id\":38,\"type\":\"success\",\"text\":\"EVIDENCE DISCOVERED: Evidence 02\"},{\"id\":39,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"\\u2192 Unclassified. Compare this evidence with the current assignment in panels [E] and [Q].\"},{\"id\":40,\"type\":\"command\",\"text\":\"detective@case004:\\/$ cat laptop\\/timeline.log\"},{\"id\":41,\"type\":\"output\",\"text\":\"LAPTOP FORENSIC TIMELINE \\u2014 EW-LAPTOP-01\\nThis file was reconstructed from records stored locally on Ethan's laptop.\\n[00:41:08] SOURCE operating-system storage log: encrypted drive ORPHEUS connected and opened\\n[00:52:31] SOURCE desktop messaging app: message received from account CLAIRE-BENNETT\\n[01:03:44] SOURCE smart-home app notification cache: guest code EW-INTERVIEW-04, created by Ethan Ward at 00:41, opened the front door. Recipient: Grant Mercer. Meeting note: \\\"ORPHEUS source interview\\\"\\n[01:12:07] SOURCE paired-phone sync cache: Ethan's phone stopped moving\\n[01:14:22] SOURCE paired-wearable sync cache: impact, sudden movement and elevated heart rate indicate a struggle\\n[01:19:50] SOURCE operating-system storage log: ORPHEUS disconnected from laptop\\nTIME BASIS: laptop synchronized to verified NTP network time; measured offset +00:00\\nNOTE: lock, phone and wearable events are synchronized copies stored by paired applications. Police-system access was performed from a separate device and is recorded only in restricted police and apartment-network logs.\",\"highlights\":[{\"start\":569,\"end\":577},{\"start\":683,\"end\":691},{\"start\":798,\"end\":823}]},{\"id\":42,\"type\":\"success\",\"text\":\"EVIDENCE DISCOVERED: Evidence 03\"},{\"id\":43,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"\\u2192 Unclassified. Compare this evidence with the current assignment in panels [E] and [Q].\"},{\"id\":44,\"type\":\"command\",\"text\":\"detective@case004:\\/$ lang vi\"},{\"id\":45,\"type\":\"success\",\"text\":\"\\u0110\\u00e3 chuy\\u1ec3n ng\\u00f4n ng\\u1eef th\\u00e0nh c\\u00f4ng.\"},{\"id\":46,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"Ng\\u00f4n ng\\u1eef hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1ea1i: vi\"},{\"id\":47,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"H\\u1ec6 TH\\u1ed0NG \\u0110I\\u1ec0U TRA LI\\u00caN NG\\u00c0NH \\/\\/ V\\u1ee4 \\u00c1N 004\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":48,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"------------------------------------------------\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":49,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"06:42 \\u2014 B\\u1ea1n t\\u1edbi v\\u00e0 phong t\\u1ecfa hi\\u1ec7n tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng c\\u0103n h\\u1ed9 17B.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":50,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"N\\u1ea1n nh\\u00e2n: Ethan Ward, nh\\u00e0 b\\u00e1o \\u0111i\\u1ec1u tra.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":51,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"Th\\u1eddi gian t\\u1eed vong \\u01b0\\u1edbc t\\u00ednh: 01:10\\u201301:35.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":52,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":null,\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":53,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"Laptop c\\u1ee7a Ethan \\u0111ang ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng c\\u1ea1nh n\\u1ea1n nh\\u00e2n. \\u1ed4 ngu\\u1ed3n tin m\\u00e3 h\\u00f3a \\u0111\\u00e3 bi\\u1ebfn m\\u1ea5t.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":54,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"B\\u1ea1n k\\u1ebft n\\u1ed1i laptop v\\u1edbi thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb ph\\u00e1p y \\u1edf ch\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ed9 ch\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u1ecdc.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":55,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"M\\u1ecdi thao t\\u00e1c ghi l\\u00ean \\u1ed5 \\u0111\\u0129a g\\u1ed1c \\u0111\\u1ec1u b\\u1ecb kh\\u00f3a \\u0111\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea3o to\\u00e0n ch\\u1ee9ng c\\u1ee9.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":56,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"Tin nh\\u1eafn kh\\u00f4i ph\\u1ee5c cho th\\u1ea5y bi\\u00ean t\\u1eadp vi\\u00ean Claire Bennett c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 \\u0111\\u00e3 b\\u1ecb b\\u1eaft c\\u00f3c v\\u00e0 v\\u1eabn c\\u00f2n s\\u1ed1ng.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":57,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"M\\u1ed9t k\\u1ebb n\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u00e3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng tr\\u00e1i ph\\u00e9p t\\u00e0i kho\\u1ea3n thu\\u1ed9c h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng v\\u1eadt ch\\u1ee9ng c\\u1ee7a c\\u1ea3nh s\\u00e1t \\u0111\\u1ec3 x\\u00f3a d\\u1ea5u v\\u1ebft.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":58,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":null,\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":59,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"M\\u00c1Y TR\\u1ea0M \\u0110ANG S\\u1eec D\\u1ee4NG: PFT-04, m\\u00e1y tr\\u1ea1m ph\\u00e1p y di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng c\\u1ee7a c\\u1ea3nh s\\u00e1t.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":60,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"B\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang nh\\u1eadp l\\u1ec7nh tr\\u00ean PFT-04, kh\\u00f4ng ph\\u1ea3i tr\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ebfp tr\\u00ean laptop c\\u1ee7a Ethan.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":61,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"Laptop c\\u1ee7a Ethan, mang m\\u00e3 v\\u1eadt ch\\u1ee9ng EW-LAPTOP-01, \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1eafn ch\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u1ecdc t\\u1ea1i \\/laptop.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":62,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"C\\u00e1c th\\u01b0 m\\u1ee5c c\\u1ea5p cao kh\\u00e1c l\\u00e0 ngu\\u1ed3n ch\\u1ee9ng c\\u1ee9 b\\u00ean ngo\\u00e0i do c\\u1ea3nh s\\u00e1t g\\u1eafn v\\u00e0o m\\u00e1y tr\\u1ea1m; ch\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng n\\u1eb1m tr\\u00ean laptop c\\u1ee7a n\\u1ea1n nh\\u00e2n.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":63,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"\\u0110\\u1ecdc \\/CASE-BRIEF.txt \\u0111\\u1ec3 n\\u1eafm t\\u00ecnh ti\\u1ebft ban \\u0111\\u1ea7u, ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi li\\u00ean quan v\\u00e0 m\\u1ee5c ti\\u00eau \\u0111i\\u1ec1u tra.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"\\u0110\\u1ecdc \\/README.txt \\u0111\\u1ec3 bi\\u1ebft m\\u1ed7i th\\u01b0 m\\u1ee5c l\\u1ea5y d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u t\\u1eeb \\u0111\\u00e2u.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":65,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"H\\u00e3y \\u0111\\u1ed1i chi\\u1ebfu \\u0111\\u1ed9c l\\u1eadp ch\\u1ee9ng c\\u1ee9 s\\u1ed1, ch\\u1ee9ng c\\u1ee9 t\\u1ea1i hi\\u1ec7n tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng v\\u00e0 d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u vi\\u1ec5n th\\u00f4ng.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":66,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"Lo\\u1ea1i b\\u1ecf c\\u00e1c d\\u1ea5u v\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u00e1nh l\\u1ea1c h\\u01b0\\u1edbng, x\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh hung th\\u1ee7, t\\u00ecm n\\u01a1i Claire b\\u1ecb giam gi\\u1eef v\\u00e0 ph\\u00ea duy\\u1ec7t tri\\u1ec3n khai \\u0111\\u1ed9i chi\\u1ebfn thu\\u1eadt theo \\u0111\\u00fang ph\\u00e1p lu\\u1eadt.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":67,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":null,\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":68,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"C\\u1ea2NH B\\u00c1O: c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ed3ng h\\u1ed3 l\\u1ec7ch nhau v\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t b\\u1ea3n ghi v\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed \\u0111\\u00e3 b\\u1ecb l\\u00e0m gi\\u1ea3.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":69,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"H\\u1ed3 s\\u01a1 c\\u1ea3nh s\\u00e1t b\\u1ecb h\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ebf c\\u1ea7n d\\u00f9ng sudo \\u0111\\u1ec3 truy c\\u1eadp.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":70,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"D\\u00f9ng help \\u0111\\u1ec3 xem to\\u00e0n b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ec7nh kh\\u1ea3 d\\u1ee5ng.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":71,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":null,\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":72,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"Ng\\u00f4n ng\\u1eef hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1ea1i: vi\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":73,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":\"G\\u00f5 \\\"help\\\" \\u0111\\u1ec3 xem c\\u00e1c l\\u1ec7nh kh\\u1ea3 d\\u1ee5ng.\",\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":74,\"type\":\"system\",\"text\":null,\"variant\":\"intro\"},{\"id\":75,\"type\":\"success\",\"text\":\"EVIDENCE \\u0110\\u00c3 X\\u00c1C NH\\u1eacN: Th\\u00f4ng tin ban \\u0111\\u1ea7u t\\u1ea1i hi\\u1ec7n tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng\"},{\"id\":76,\"type\":\"success\",\"text\":\"\\u2192 \\u1ed4 \\u0111\\u0129a ch\\u1ee9a t\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u m\\u1eadt \\u0111\\u00e3 bi\\u1ebfn m\\u1ea5t; hi\\u1ec7n tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng c\\u00f2n c\\u00f3 hai chi\\u1ebfc c\\u1ed1c, m\\u1ed9t \\u0111\\u1ed3ng h\\u1ed3 ch\\u1ea1y sai v\\u00e0 cu\\u1ed1ng v\\u00e9 \\u0111\\u1ed7 xe P-4187.\"},{\"id\":77,\"type\":\"success\",\"text\":\"EVIDENCE \\u0110\\u00c3 X\\u00c1C NH\\u1eacN: Kho\\u1ea3ng th\\u1eddi gian x\\u1ea3y ra \\u00e1n m\\u1ea1ng theo ph\\u00e1p y\"},{\"id\":78,\"type\":\"success\",\"text\":\"\\u2192 K\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 x\\u00e9t nghi\\u1ec7m chi\\u1ebfc c\\u1ed1c, d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ed3ng h\\u1ed3 \\u0111eo tay v\\u00e0 d\\u1ea5u v\\u1ebft tr\\u00ean lan c