r: torn parking stub P-4187\nBedroom network clock displays 01:18. Smart-home hub synchronization audit shows that clock was 17 minutes slow against verified network time","highlights":[{"start":167,"end":175},{"start":232,"end":238},{"start":335,"end":350}]},{"id":31,"type":"success","text":"EVIDENCE DISCOVERED: Evidence 01"},{"id":32,"type":"system","text":"\u2192 Unclassified. Compare this evidence with the current assignment in panels [E] and [Q]."},{"id":33,"type":"command","text":"detective@case004:\/$ cat scene\/forensics.txt"},{"id":34,"type":"output","text":"FORENSIC PRELIMINARY\nDeath window: 01:10\u201301:35 TRUE TIME\nSedative residue in rinsed cup\nPartial pressure mark through a torn glove: right thumb area contains a scar-shaped interruption\nBlue alkyd paint flakes and jute fibers on balcony rail\nVictim's phone stopped moving at 01:12; wearable motion and heart-rate data indicate a struggle at 01:14","highlights":[{"start":35,"end":56},{"start":132,"end":143},{"start":185,"end":201},{"start":213,"end":224}]},{"id":35,"type":"success","text":"EVIDENCE DISCOVERED: Evidence 02"},{"id":36,"type":"system","text":"\u2192 Unclassified. Compare this evidence with the current assignment in panels [E] and [Q]."},{"id":37,"type":"command","text":"detective@case004:\/$ cat laptop\/timeline.log"},{"id":38,"type":"output","text":"LAPTOP FORENSIC TIMELINE \u2014 EW-LAPTOP-01\nThis file was reconstructed from records stored locally on Ethan's laptop.\n[00:41:08] SOURCE operating-system storage log: encrypted drive ORPHEUS connected and opened\n[00:52:31] SOURCE desktop messaging app: message received from account CLAIRE-BENNETT\n[01:03:44] SOURCE smart-home app notification cache: guest code EW-INTERVIEW-04, created by Ethan Ward at 00:41, opened the front door. Recipient: Grant Mercer. Meeting note: \"ORPHEUS source interview\"\n[01:12:07] SOURCE paired-phone sync cache: Ethan's phone stopped moving\n[01:14:22] SOURCE paired-wearable sync cache: impact, sudden movement and elevated heart rate indicate a struggle\n[01:19:50] SOURCE operating-system storage log: ORPHEUS disconnected from laptop\nTIME BASIS: laptop synchronized to verified NTP network time; measured offset +00:00\nNOTE: lock, phone and wearable events are synchronized copies stored by paired applications. Police-system access was performed from a separate device and is recorded only in restricted police and apartment-network logs.","highlights":[{"start":569,"end":577},{"start":683,"end":691},{"start":798,"end":823}]},{"id":39,"type":"success","text":"EVIDENCE DISCOVERED: Evidence 03"},{"id":40,"type":"system","text":"\u2192 Unclassified. Compare this evidence with the current assignment in panels [E] and [Q]."},{"id":41,"type":"command","text":"detective@case004:\/$ lang vi"},{"id":42,"type":"success","text":"\u0110\u00e3 chuy\u1ec3n ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng."},{"id":43,"type":"system","text":"Ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i: vi"},{"id":44,"type":"system","text":"H\u1ec6 TH\u1ed0NG \u0110I\u1ec0U TRA LI\u00caN NG\u00c0NH \/\/ V\u1ee4 \u00c1N 004","variant":"intro"},{"id":45,"type":"system","text":"------------------------------------------------","variant":"intro"},{"id":46,"type":"system","text":"06:42 \u2014 B\u1ea1n t\u1edbi v\u00e0 phong t\u1ecfa hi\u1ec7n tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u0103n h\u1ed9 17B.","variant":"intro"},{"id":47,"type":"system","text":"N\u1ea1n nh\u00e2n: Ethan Ward, nh\u00e0 b\u00e1o \u0111i\u1ec1u tra.","variant":"intro"},{"id":48,"type":"system","text":"Th\u1eddi gian t\u1eed vong \u01b0\u1edbc t\u00ednh: 01:10\u201301:35.","variant":"intro"},{"id":49,"type":"system","text":null,"variant":"intro"},{"id":50,"type":"system","text":"Laptop c\u1ee7a Ethan \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ea1nh n\u1ea1n nh\u00e2n. \u1ed4 ngu\u1ed3n tin m\u00e3 h\u00f3a \u0111\u00e3 bi\u1ebfn m\u1ea5t.","variant":"intro"},{"id":51,"type":"system","text":"B\u1ea1n k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i laptop v\u1edbi thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb ph\u00e1p y \u1edf ch\u